# PPTX generation

Export from LayoutIR using PptxGenJS native objects.

- Text stays `addText`
- Rects, round rects, ellipses, and chevrons stay `addShape`
- Slide size is 16:9 widescreen (13.333" × 7.5")
- Never rasterize the finished slide to PNG/JPEG
- Do not read copy from React components; use the compiled presentation

```ts
// BAD
slide.addImage({ data: screenshotPng, x: 0, y: 0, w: 13.33, h: 7.5 });

// GOOD
slide.addText(node.text, { x, y, w, h, fontFace: "Calibri", fontSize });
```
